      "text": "Hello, my name is Deborah Berlin. I'm Executive Director of Project Goal, the project to get older adults online. I'm pleased to join you to talk about technology innovations, AI and aging. The world is aging. The number of older individuals globally is growing exponentially. According to the World Health Organization between the years 2015 and 2050, the proportion of the world's population of those 60 years and older will nearly double from 12% to 22%. In just five years, 2030, one in six people in the world will be 60 and older. As older populations increase and the working and younger aging ages decrease, resources to assist with aging need grow increasingly scarce, creating a significant gap in services.",
